; wap-doc.def -- wap.lib export surface for Windows CE.
;
; Copyright (c) 2026 Akari API contributors
; SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
;
; Derived exclusively from the official Microsoft CE
; documentation pages: each name below appears as a
; page title whose Requirements row names this link
; library (wince-docs-corpus) and is declared with
; AKARI_CE_IMPORT by this tree's headers (include/Wap.h).
; No shared-source/device-dump/VS/PB-derived name is
; used.  Ordinals are not published; entries are
; name-only.
;
; NEW 2026-09-19: this file did not exist before this
; cross-check; docs/def-gap-triage-2026-09-18.tsv listed
; "wap" as COM-only ("WAP push / services") without
; checking for plain function exports.  6 of its 12
; documented pages are flat C functions, not COM
; methods -- see include/Wap.h for the page-id citations.
LIBRARY wap.dll
EXPORTS
  WapClose
  WapGetNextPrimitiveSize
  WapOpen
  WapPing
  WapRead
  WapSend
